     "section": "Authentication",
     "score": 8.282270431518555,
     "text": "Every request must carry an API key in the `X-Aurora-Key` header. Keys beginning with `ak_test_` operate on the sandbox; keys beginning with `ak_live_` operate on production. Keys expire after 90 days and must be rotated from the Developer Console. Aurora does not support OAuth 2.0 client credentials in version 4; OAuth support is planned for version 5."
